{"action": "setfields", "pairs": [{"label": "country", "value": "United States"}, {"label": "cover letter", "value": "I'm applying for the Senior/Staff Fullstack Engineer role at Linear. I care about the things Linear is known for - speed, craft, and getting the details right. The clearest proof: I cut a production dashboard's time-to-first-byte from 5 seconds to 0.5 seconds by re-architecting its data layer around pre-aggregation caching, rolled out incrementally with zero downtime. I ship full-stack in TypeScript, React/Next.js, Node and Python on AWS, and I run an AI-native workflow (custom MCP servers, agent tooling) that lets me move fast without dropping quality. Portfolio: bunlongheng.com."}, {"label": "what would you want to work on", "value": "Product-facing platform and AI-native tooling that customers feel directly - the performance, developer-experience, and craft work Linear is known for. I want the engineering I ship to be the product itself, not internal infrastructure."}, {"label": "put yourself", "value": "Re-architecting a live analytics dashboard whose time-to-first-byte was 5 seconds, without breaking its consumers. It meant owning a risky, highly visible change end to end: I introduced Cube Store pre-aggregation caching, redesigned the query layer, and rolled it out incrementally. TTFB dropped to 0.5s with zero downtime."}, {"label": "extremely good at", "value": "Shipping AI-native full-stack products fast without sacrificing quality - TypeScript/React/Next.js/Node/Python on AWS, plus LLM integration, RAG, and MCP servers. I've built an AI code reviewer for every open PR, an AI deploy assistant, and natural-language analytics search. My portfolio scores a perfect 100 across all four Lighthouse categories."}], "tabId": 1232840932, "status": "delivered", "queued": "2026-07-22"}
